      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. It creates an `InterpolatorStringLookup` with `XmlDecoderStringLookup` as the default lookup, then calls `lookup(\":XML_DECODER\")` — a key with an empty prefix — which falls through to the default lookup with key `\"XML_DECODER\"`, and since there's no XML encoding, `XmlDecoderStringLookup` returns the string as-is.\n\nLet me write the improved version with better naming and explanatory structure.The improved test compiled successfully."
